		-- chamber off the Desert Resort (zone 158) and keeps the plain name; 161-165 are the five
		-- basements the story runs through. Identified from the game's own content, not from the ids:
		-- 161 holds Ryoku ("Go! Hurry and fall through the flowing sands!", script bank 169) and 165 holds
