		-- ⭐ THE STAIRS ARE A FACT OF THE DATA, not a reading of the map. Warp record +0x05 is the
		-- transition type the arrival rule above already uses, and **type 2 is a level change everywhere
		-- in the game**: censused over all 427 zones (research/re/warp_type2_check.py) it joins 67 zone
