	--   2101 (model 79, back-left)  = Union Room counter — "Welcome to the Pokemon Wireless Club Union Room".
	--   10100 (model 82, back-mid)  = Wi-Fi Club counter — "Welcome to the Pokemon Wi-Fi Club!"
	--   10105 (model 81, back-right)= Global Terminal counter — "Welcome to the Global Terminal!"
