		-- the FINAL fall callback - until then the slot stays all -1. The status mark 0x280 goes up at fall
		-- START, so status alone would call the hole crossable for the frames the rock is still in the air
		-- (codex-review verification 2026-09-02).
		-- ⭐ THE RECORD IS THE ROCK'S SAVED WORLD POSITION, not a flag: 0x0216E564 copies its twelve bytes
