			-- floor (cs.stfill) so the router will cross it. Asking it whether those tiles are still class
			-- 0x1D is asking the fix whether the fix happened — the answer is always no, the two
			-- "independent" signals could never agree again, and this failed closed on every fallen rock,
			-- killing the planner the moment one landed (codex-review verification 2026-09-02).
			-- A second signal that is downstream of the first is not a second signal.
