				-- is written is in its hole; if the loaded actor is somewhere else, the room is in a state
				-- this module does not model, and the two ways of being wrong are opposite (route through a
				-- solid rock, or refuse a hole that is filled). Silence is the only honest answer, and this
				-- has never been observed — the fall finalizer sets the actor's coordinates from the same
