	-- for ever and a two-push puzzle could never advance past its first press (codex-review 2026-09-02).
	-- Fallen rocks are in the string too: the frame one lands is the frame the bridge appears.
	-- ⛔⛔ AND IT MUST NOT CHANGE WHILE A ROCK IS IN THE AIR. The engine puts the boulder's CURRENT
