		-- and then left the BFS's own key as (tile, poses). The entrance corridor runs under the upper
		-- gallery, so starting anywhere on lower (29,49) marks that key visited, and the later rail edge to
		-- the gallery's handoff — the SAME coordinate at height 7 — is discarded as already seen before its
		-- height-aware flood is ever consulted. The planner would then miss a genuine state and either
		-- report no route or pick unnecessary switches, and (29,49) is a tile right beside the door.
