			-- unchanged, so a goal reachable over the rails but needing no switch came back as plain nil —
			-- "just walk" — and the generic router cannot walk it: pf_build only picks a handoff when the
			-- goal is a WARP, and the follower's crossing cue needs `pf.warp or pf.rl0`. Iris is a
			-- grid-form actor beyond a rail crossing, so the LAST leg of the whole gym would have ended at
