			-- walks the grid half, stepping on the 0xA3 tile flips the controller to rail, and the crossing
			-- check at the top of pf_update re-plans — from there pf_build_rail knows how to exit toward a
			-- grid goal. Plain nil now means one thing only: the goal is walkable from where you stand.
