					              -- and needs one more press into the blocked side. My first cut suppressed
					              -- the leg here and returned plain nil, which leaves them standing on the
					              -- tile with nothing said; the cut before THAT emitted a bare zero-length
					              -- route and the offline probe oscillated between (10,7) and (11,29) for
					              -- ever. Both were wrong for the same reason: the leg has to carry the
					              -- PRESS, the way the cannon and ride legs do. pf_build turns this into a
					              -- one-word instruction below (codex-review verification 2026-08-27, HIGH).
