		end
		ow.dg.pend = nil                                                -- a fresh request supersedes any held one
		-- Toggle off by the ENTRY, not only by its coordinates: a grid warp is a REGION whose aim point
		-- follows the player, and a rail warp reached across the grid is aimed at its line rather than at
