		-- about a cause I have not seen. One line of evidence first.
		-- ⛔⛔ AND NOW IT IS THE FIX, NOT THE INSTRUMENT. This block was added on 2026-08-26 to RECORD a
		-- mismatch I could not explain: Ola routed to Brycen and was told he had arrived a tile up and to
		-- the LEFT of him — a diagonal, which is not a tile you can talk to anyone from. I deliberately
		-- did not act then: "the obvious fix is a change to every person route in the game, and I am not
		-- making it on a guess about a cause I have not seen. One line of evidence first."
